ଦ୍ଧ୍ୱସ୍ଥ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ବଳବାନ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତୁମ୍ଭର ପ୍ରମାଣ-ବାକ୍ୟ ଅତି ନିଶ୍ଚିତ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୋ, ପବିତ୍ରତା ସର୍ବଦା ତୁମ୍ଭ ଗୃହର ଶୋଭା।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/93.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/94.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/92.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}